# RIMSHIRE: stepping onto the enemy's route starts a battle there; the
# enemy army is pulled back to that point, and the side that stepped acts
# first.
game rimshire
cheat war 4
cheat step 1 12 2
cheat step 1 12 1
cheat step 1 12 0
cheat step 1 11 0
expect trail1 == 5
cheat at 0 12 3
cheat turn 0
press UP
expect plan_n == 1
expect plan_ready == 1
press A
waituntil state == 5 60
expect nx1 == 12
expect ny1 == 2
expect trail1 == 2
waituntil bphase == 1 200
expect bside == 0
